  "prefLabel": "Ve-H 219.05 Effect of Declaratory Rulings",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ve-H 219.05 Effect of Declaratory Rulings. A declaratory ruling shall apply only to the board and to the person requesting it and shall be confined to the facts presented in the original request and in response to a request for additional information made by the board.\n\nSource. #8951, eff 7-21-07",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ve-h100-400.html"
